Not bundled. This directory is excluded from the RedFluentVPNTunnel target (project.yml)
and nothing in it ships in the app.

The extension used to fall back to a shared config here (review-tunnel.json, production
VLESS + Reality credentials) whenever the per-device fetch failed. That fallback is gone:
the tunnel now connects only with the config the server issues to the device, or, when the
server cannot be reached, the last one it got (App Group, at most 30 days old).
See StartPolicy in Tunnel/RegionFollow.swift.

scripts/verify-ipa-clean.sh fails any IPA that contains review-tunnel.json.
